-- SilAlt.df-- The CedarChest 6.0 build of Sil, staged for a version experiment.-- CedarChest 6.1 has NO BiScrollers payload directory, so our mirrored-- BiScrollersImpl.BCD is byte-identical to 6.0's !4 -- while Sil.bcd!4 from-- 6.1 wants the 6.1 BiScrollers, which exists nowhere in the archive.-- Hence: try 6.0's Sil (Sil.bcd!18, 07-May-86, Pier.pa) against the 6.0-- BiScrollers we already have.  Renamed Sil6.bcd so it can sit beside the-- 6.1 Sil.bcd on the same volume.  See docs/sil-schematics-handoff.md.Exports [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>  SilAlt.df!1                                  31-Jul-86 12:00:00 PDTExports [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>SilAlt>  Sil6.bcd!1                                   07-May-86 10:35:28 PDT